OL,3,GNEWSACouncil may withdraw from
OL,4,AIsrael-linked investments
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors in Birmingham have voted
OL,7,Ffor a proposal to seek to withdraw from
OL,8,Fany financial investments linked to
OL,9,FIsrael.
OL,11,FThe motion was proposed by independent
OL,12,Fcouncillor Nosheen Khalid, who is a
OL,13,Fmember of the Better Birmingham Group
OL,14,Fwhich is part of the ruling coalition,
OL,15,Fand the council's cabinet member for
OL,16,Fhealth and social care.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
