OL,3,GNEWSACouncil may withdraw from
OL,4,AIsrael-linked investments
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite a ceasefire coming into force
OL,7,Fin Gaza in October 2025, Israel has
OL,8,Fcontinued air strikes almost every day.
OL,9,FMore than 1,500 people have been
OL,10,Fkilled, according to Gaza's Hamas-run
OL,11,Fhealth ministry.
OL,13,FThe conflict was triggered by the
OL,14,FHamas-led attack on Israel on 7 October
OL,15,F2023, when about 1,200 people were
OL,16,Fkilled and 251 taken hostage.
